          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio elomo eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi yecha khu Elicha Omutishibe eli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Waboone nga Ahabu ne eboombiisie ebweeni wase? Sikila omwene eboombiisie ebweeni wase, se nja khureera libuna mu siise siewe tawe. Ne kakhali nja khureera libuna mu siise sio musoleeli wewe khu nju eya Ahabu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.29"
            ]
          }
        }
